he  results are exactly what we're seeing  right now send me your thoughts on  democracy being inherently or  intrinsically good we've got a great  bonus show today I'll tell you about all  the wacky stuff that's been going on  this week behind the scenes the holiday  schedule and much more  patreon Membership YouTube membership  three ways to get access to the bonus  show we'll speak to you then
 

